{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lair of the Leviathan",
    "steam_appid": 2752020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/ed1bfc13f3ab793ad17e724c58c4ddee.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging tactical combat involving the use of dozens of available abilities. Each party member brings with them different specialties and it's up to you how to combine them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b8b9b63e83b7ecb873fb0b358923baed.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=708 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non linear story that allows you to progress the way you wish. The world is filled with both quests and dungeons big and small, from small monster caves to multi floored mega dungeons there is a variety of things to do and discover. All locations are hand crafted, no procedural generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/140350276dc885bd3f62ce0e748ea607.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=540 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are a variety of different premade npcs to choose from or for those who prefer to create their entire parties, you can completely customise your party members with a deep character creator including all skills, classes, combat sprites and character portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b3f45e69d327c012e5a9ff1668ced644.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A large open world to explore in your own way, at your own pace with dozen of handcrafted dungeon locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Assemble a party of customisable characters each with their own combat and non combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Fight 100s of different enemies each with their own unique abilities in turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/ed1bfc13f3ab793ad17e724c58c4ddee.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/d9be29a9b5ddd36e3e4e0fe1d611b85a.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging tactical combat involving the use of dozens of available abilities. Each party member brings with them different specialties and it's up to you how to combine them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b8b9b63e83b7ecb873fb0b358923baed.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=708 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/21684d644affb3f40d900a03dd8add71.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non linear story that allows you to progress the way you wish. The world is filled with both quests and dungeons big and small, from small monster caves to multi floored mega dungeons there is a variety of things to do and discover. All locations are hand crafted, no procedural generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/140350276dc885bd3f62ce0e748ea607.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=540 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/cd1d1f1151a02c338a100dc1beaeee90.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are a variety of different premade npcs to choose from or for those who prefer to create their entire parties, you can completely customise your party members with a deep character creator including all skills, classes, combat sprites and character portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/15eb7fbe46b6fb7341ec98c9bbf9526c.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b3f45e69d327c012e5a9ff1668ced644.avif?t=1749187217\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A large open world to explore in your own way, at your own pace with dozen of handcrafted dungeon locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Assemble a party of customisable characters each with their own combat and non combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Fight 100s of different enemies each with their own unique abilities in turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.poster.avif?t=1749187217\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.webm?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/86e6765e580b608237a49f32bd0d2829.mp4?t=1749187217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
